  abstract    = {Co-authored during my time as a Senior Analyst at Fundación IDEA. Examines the multifaceted impact of atopic dermatitis in Mexico on patients' quality of life, including physical discomfort, psychological effects, and social implications, as well as the disease's economic burden (direct medical and indirect costs). My responsibilities included designing the methodology and survey instruments, conducting interviews and data collection, and performing descriptive statistical analysis and data visualization (in Python).},
